#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:26
msgid "Triage in one place"
msgstr "Triage op een plek"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:27
msgid ""
"Pending / All / Spam / Trash / Mine tabs — every status surface in a single "
"window with live counts."
msgstr ""
"Hangende / Alles / Strooipos / Asblik / Myn-oortjies - elke statusoppervlak "
"in 'n enkele venster met lewendige tellings."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:33
msgid "Bulk moderation with undo"
msgstr "Grootmaat moderering met ontdoen"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:34
msgid ""
"Multi-select and approve, spam, or trash dozens at once. Every action shows "
"an 8-second undo toast."
msgstr ""
"Multi-kies en goedkeur, strooipos, of asblik dosyne op een slag. Elke aksie "
"wys 'n 8-sekonde ongedaan-toast."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:40
msgid "Inline reply"
msgstr "Inlyn antwoord"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:41
msgid ""
"Reply right inside the row — no modal, no full-page navigation. Press R on "
"any row to jump straight to the editor."
msgstr ""
"Antwoord reg binne die ry - geen modaal, geen volbladnavigasie nie. Druk R "
"op enige ry om reguit na die redigeerder te spring."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:47
msgid "Spam confidence score"
msgstr "Spam vertroue telling"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:48
msgid ""
"Every comment gets a 0–100 score from Akismet + heuristics. Optionally turn "
"on AI scoring in OS Settings → Features so each new comment is also scored "
"by your configured AI provider on arrival."
msgstr ""
"Elke opmerking kry 'n 0–100-telling van Akismet + heuristiek. Skakel KI-"
"telling opsioneel aan in OS-instellings → Kenmerke sodat elke nuwe opmerking"
" ook deur jou gekonfigureerde KI-verskaffer by aankoms aangeteken word."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:54
msgid "Author insights drawer"
msgstr "Skrywer insigte laai"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:55
msgid ""
"Click an avatar to see the author's full history — total comments, spam "
"rate, first seen, and one-click block."
msgstr ""
"Klik op 'n avatar om die skrywer se volle geskiedenis te sien - totale "
"opmerkings, strooiposkoers, eerste gesien, en een-klik blok."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:61
#: includes/comments-window/window.php:61
msgid "Keyboard moderation"
msgstr "Sleutelbord moderering"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:62
msgid ""
"J/K to navigate, A approve, S spam, D trash, R reply, E edit, U undo. Press "
"? any time for the cheat sheet."
msgstr ""
"J/K om te navigeer, A goedkeur, S strooipos, D asblik, R antwoord, E wysig, "
"U ongedaan maak. Druk ? enige tyd vir die cheat sheet."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:83
msgid "Welcome to the new Comments"
msgstr "Welkom by die nuwe kommentaar"

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:88
msgid ""
"A moderation surface built around how you actually triage: bulk actions with"
" undo, an inline reply editor, keyboard shortcuts, and a spam score that "
"surfaces the obvious junk first."
msgstr ""
"'n Modereringsoppervlak gebou rondom hoe jy eintlik triage: grootmaat aksies"
" met ontdoen, 'n inlyn antwoordredigeerder, sleutelbordkortpaaie en 'n "
"strooipostelling wat die ooglopende gemors eerste na vore kom."

#: src/comments-window/intro-dialog.ts:114
msgid ""
"Prefer the classic Comments screen? You can switch back any time from OS "
"Settings → Features."
msgstr ""
"Verkies jy die klassieke Opmerkings-skerm? Jy kan enige tyd terugskakel "
"vanaf OS-instellings → Kenmerke."

