#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:346
msgid "Use the native Plugins window"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:351
msgid ""
"A native two-tab Plugins window: an Installed list with bulk activate / "
"deactivate / delete, and a Browse gallery powered by the WordPress.org "
"repository — rich detail flyout with screenshots, ratings histogram, and "
"recent reviews. Drag a .zip onto the window to install, or drag a card from "
"Browse to the dock to pin it. On by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:358
msgid "Use the native Comments window"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:363
msgid ""
"A redesigned moderation queue with Pending / All / Spam / Trash / Mine tabs,"
" bulk approve/spam/trash plus an 8-second undo, inline reply right in the "
"row, an author insights drawer, a per-row spam confidence score (Akismet + "
"heuristics), and full keyboard moderation (j/k navigate, a approve, s spam, "
"d trash, r reply, e edit, u undo). On by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:372
msgid "Score new comments with AI"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:379
msgid ""
"When a new comment lands, your configured AI provider scores it for spam and"
" hostility. The verdict appears in the per-row chip and is folded into the "
"spam confidence score. Token usage applies — admin-only site setting."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:382
msgid ""
"Configure an AI provider in OS Settings → AI first. Once a provider is set "
"up, this toggle becomes available and every new comment is scored on "
"arrival."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:391
msgid "Show desktop when clicking the wallpaper"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:398
msgid ""
"macOS-style gesture: a left click on the empty desktop minimizes every "
"window, and a second click restores them. When on, the matching \"Show "
"desktop\" entry is removed from the wallpaper context menu — the click "
"gesture replaces it. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:405
msgid "Show post/page status ribbon"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:412
msgid ""
"Paints a diagonal corner ribbon — Draft, Pending, Private, or Scheduled — on"
" My WordPress tiles whose post status isn’t published. Off hides every "
"ribbon; tiles still respect their dimmed-icon treatment so unpublished items"
" remain visible at a glance. On by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:419
msgid "Folder sharing"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:424
msgid ""
"Lets you share desktop folders with other users or roles, with read or "
"read+write access. When off, every share-related affordance (Share button, "
"invites, \"Leave shared folder\") disappears from your shell and the "
"heartbeat stops delivering share payloads to your session. Other users are "
"unaffected. On by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:437
msgid "Deleting…"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:438
msgid "Delete folder sharing data"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:441
msgid ""
"Site-wide destructive action (admin only). Drops every shares table — "
"invites, decisions, share rows. Empty tables are recreated immediately so "
"the feature still works for anyone who wants to start fresh. Use this on "
"sites that never needed sharing to clear the data outright."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:451
msgid "WordPress Heartbeat rate"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:458
msgid "Fast — 15s (not recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:459
msgid "Medium — 30s"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:460
msgid "Slow — 45s"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:461
msgid "Very slow — 60s (default)"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:465
msgid ""
"How often the WordPress Heartbeat API runs. Faster = quicker live updates "
"(autosaves, lock checks, the heartbeat widget) at the cost of more server "
"traffic. 15 s triples server load vs. the 60 s default — use sparingly. 30 s"
" and 45 s require a page reload to apply exactly; 15 s and 60 s take effect "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:477
msgid "Resetting…"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:478
msgid "Reset what’s-new dialogs"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings/sections/features.ts:481
